   Lu, Wei; Xia, Wei; Shoemaker, Christine A., Natl Univ Singapore, Ind Syst Engn \& Management, Singapore, Singapore.
   Shoemaker, Christine A., Natl Univ Singapore, Dept Civil \& Environm Engn, Singapore, Singapore.},
